    <briefdescription>
<para>Minimal mock plugin that models the RocksDB vs. in-memory branch. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When <computeroutput>config_json</computeroutput> contains <computeroutput>"rocksdb_dir"</computeroutput> and the value is non-empty, <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1llm__wiki_1_1tests_1_1_mock_l_l_m_wiki_plugin_1aeee59a0be86f37d6943c72006d23e8d0" kindref="member">initialize()</ref></computeroutput> records that the RocksDB path was requested. Otherwise it falls back to the in-memory path. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
